%%label II. Andante con moto
%%note F major. A hymn-like theme in the strings; a variation with the theme in the woodwinds over a running cello line.
X:1
T:Beethoven’s Second Missing Symphony
T:II. Andante con moto
C:Lor, in the manner of Beethoven
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Andante con moto" 1/4=66
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tp] tm [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% The score is written at sounding pitch. Dynamics in the wind, brass and double-bass parts are set one to three levels below the strings to balance the playback samples of this site; they are a playback compromise, not dynamics for live players.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl."
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob."
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl."
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn."
V:hn clef=treble name="Hn."
V:tp clef=treble name="Tpt."
V:tm clef=bass name="Timp."
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
K:F
V:fl
